# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": "local"
}

### create or update file
PUT {{host}}/api/workspaces/{{workspace}}/files/{{note}}
Content-Type: text/markdown
Cookie: {{login.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

# Manual Test

Updated from gateway HTTP files.

### update nested file
PUT {{host}}/api/workspaces/{{workspace}}/files/notes/nested/manual-test.md
Content-Type: text/markdown
Cookie: {{login.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

# Nested Manual Test

### invalid path
PUT {{host}}/api/workspaces/{{workspace}}/files/%2E%2E/secret.md
Content-Type: text/markdown
Cookie: {{login.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

# Should fail

### non-markdown path
PUT {{host}}/api/workspaces/{{workspace}}/files/notes/manual-test.txt
Content-Type: text/plain
Cookie: {{login.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

Should fail

### unauthenticated
PUT {{host}}/api/workspaces/{{workspace}}/files/{{note}}
Content-Type: text/markdown
Cookie: lirox_session=invalid

# Should fail
